  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF\r\nCONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION 24/1323\r\nRELATING TO THE RESTORATION, ALTERATION AND EXTENSIONS TO THE EXISTING LISTED\r\nHOUSE AND COACH HOUSE BUILDINGS. INCLUDING THE DEMOLITION AND REBUILDING OF THE\r\nREAR CENTRAL AND EASTERN EXTENSIONS, THE FORMATION OF A NEW FORECOURT GARAGE\r\nAND ARTISTS STUDIO BUILDINGS AND A BASEMENT POOL/SPA EXTENSION BELOW THE REAR\r\nGARDEN. WITH ASSOCIATED RE-LANDSCAPING OF FRONT AND REAR GARDENS AND REBUILDING\r\nOF THE FRONT BOUNDARY WALL, REINSTATING PEDESTRIAN GATES, GATE POSTS AND\r\nWIDENED VEHICULAR GATES. CHANGES INCLUDE THE REPOSITIONING OF THE STAIR CORE\r\nAND REAR CHAPEL EXTENSION, AN INCREASE IN MASSING OF THE REAR CHAPEL EXTENSION\r\nAT LOWER GROUND, UPPER GROUND, 1ST AND 2ND FLOOR LEVEL, A\r\nRAISED TERRACE AT THE REAR, THE ADDITION OF A CHIMNEY TO THE SE SIDE ELEVATION\r\nAND OTHER INTERNAL ALTERATIONS",
